  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Accountability and Equal Rights of Citizens in Wera dijo woreda of Halaba Zone.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve basic services by strengthening the capacity of duty bearers and promoting meaningful citizen engagement, with particular attention to vulnerable groups. It seeks to increase community voice, transparency, and accountability among local authorities, while also enhancing active participation, decision&#x2011;making, and social equality. Through policy awareness and empowerment initiatives, the project will support women, men, youth, and persons with disabilities to engage more effectively in local governance and community development processes.</narrative>
  </description>
